1
00:00:32,680 --> 00:00:33,760
Did I make myself clear?

2
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:37,400
Seventh Prince

3
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:42,000
You know it's always been me protecting you

4
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:44,040
The one you love is me

5
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:47,080
If you have any difficulties

6
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:48,920
You can tell me

7
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:51,960
But please don't deceive me

8
00:01:08,760 --> 00:01:09,840
You don't need to know

9
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,800
I've been trying to hide it to keep you out of danger

10
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:14,520
Zhi'an

11
00:01:15,320 --> 00:01:16,720
I'm your husband

12
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:20,680
How could you mistake me for the Seventh Prince?

13
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:23,320
I was drunk yesterday

14
00:01:23,320 --> 00:01:24,200
And acted improperly

15
00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:25,960
Please don't blame me

16
00:01:28,960 --> 00:01:31,440
So you choose to keep deceiving me

17
00:01:32,240 --> 00:01:34,720
I almost believed your sincerity

18
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,760
How ridiculous

19
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:46,000
It seems I've truly wronged my husband

20
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:48,520
Then let me apologize to you

21
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:52,240
That day my husband didn't stay to rest

22
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:55,240
I slept very restlessly alone

23
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:56,960
Tonight

24
00:01:58,400 --> 00:02:00,400
My lord, you'll definitely stay with me, won't you?

25
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:07,160
Are you alright?

26
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:09,760
I'm fine, I can manage on my own

27
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:13,320
My lord won't let me touch you

28
00:02:14,480 --> 00:02:15,840
Are you still blaming me?

29
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:19,080
No

30
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:22,680
You've had too much to drink

31
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:24,000
Go to sleep

32
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:50,840
My lord, where are you going?

33
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:53,840
We've been married for so long

34
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,840
Yet we still haven't consummated our marriage

35
00:02:56,880 --> 00:02:58,280
Don't you want to?

36
00:03:36,080 --> 00:03:37,200
No one is allowed to touch you

37
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:40,120
Not even me

38
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:44,720
You're drunk

39
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:47,200
Go to sleep now

40
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,360
Why won't you take the Dragon Jade?

41
00:03:59,320 --> 00:04:03,160
Zhu Huaijin, if you're just using me for power

42
00:04:03,440 --> 00:04:06,360
I'll end you and we'll both be free

43
00:04:07,160 --> 00:04:08,120
Like this now

44
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:09,960
What exactly do you want to do?

45
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:12,560
But whatever you intend

46
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:14,480
I no longer have the heart to investigate

47
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,000
The road ahead

48
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:17,600
I'll walk alone

49
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:19,120
What?

50
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,000
The Dragon Jade is in South Mountain

51
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:24,120
I'm not entirely sure about the treasure's exact location

52
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:25,800
I only vaguely remember

53
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:28,360
It's probably in South Mountain at the border between Nanliang and Beijin

54
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:29,840
No matter

55
00:04:30,280 --> 00:04:31,480
Dispatch people immediately

56
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:32,600
Head to South Mountain at once

57
00:04:42,400 --> 00:04:43,320
South Mountain

58
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,640
It's getting dark

59
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,640
We'll rest here tonight

60
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:54,120
We'll start searching the mountain first thing tomorrow morning

61
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:55,480
Understood

62
00:05:00,520 --> 00:05:02,160
Why are you picking these weeds?

63
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:04,720
These are Golden Shore herbs

64
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:05,600
Snake venom antidote

65
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,560
Gather some just in case

66
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,960
Why wouldn't Zhu Huaichen recognize golden shore grass?

67
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:10,320
Back in the mountain cave

68
00:05:10,320 --> 00:05:12,920
He used this exact herb to delay the poison's effects for me

69
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:14,480
Who exactly are you?

70
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:16,240
How do you know about me?

71
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:18,040
I...

72
00:05:19,400 --> 00:05:20,960
You could say we're old acquaintances

73
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:23,160
In any case, I mean you no harm

74
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:24,600
Oh

75
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:26,440
This is golden shore grass

76
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,880
It has detoxifying properties

77
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:29,720
There aren't many medicines on this mountain

78
00:05:30,400 --> 00:05:31,640
Let me apply it for you

79
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:44,120
Night is falling

80
00:05:44,320 --> 00:05:46,000
I need to find a way out quickly

81
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:47,280
Enter the mountains to find the princess

82
00:05:51,320 --> 00:05:52,280
Take this with you

83
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:53,400
It repels snake venom

84
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:58,080
I need to relieve myself

85
00:05:58,720 --> 00:05:59,640
I'll accompany you

86
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:15,200
Your Highness, please do as you wish

87
00:06:15,200 --> 00:06:16,960
Call me when you're finished

88
00:06:17,520 --> 00:06:18,320
Alright

89
00:06:29,520 --> 00:06:30,880
In these deep mountains and dense forests

90
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:32,280
If you get lost

91
00:06:32,280 --> 00:06:33,360
Don't blame me

92
00:06:36,200 --> 00:06:38,640
I really should thank you, Duan Yurou

93
00:07:13,880 --> 00:07:14,680
Zhi'an

94
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:16,920
Who's there?

95
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:18,480
Is that my husband?

96
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:20,360
It's Huaijin

97
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:23,960
You were caught in a hunter's trap earlier

98
00:07:23,960 --> 00:07:25,160
But you're safe now

99
00:07:26,640 --> 00:07:27,840
Are you following me?

100
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:32,360
We've found the princess consort

101
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:32,880
You all go ahead

102
00:07:32,880 --> 00:07:33,320
I'll handle things here

103
00:07:33,320 --> 00:07:33,680
Understood

104
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:38,480
I didn't mean to follow you

105
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,600
I just noticed you hadn't returned for a long time

106
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:41,320
And grew concerned

107
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:43,360
So I followed your trail to check on you

108
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:44,520
I didn't expect you'd gone so far

109
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:45,520
This is too dangerous

110
00:07:48,200 --> 00:07:49,600
My husband is the one who should worry about me

111
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:50,840
You're overstepping your bounds

112
00:07:58,760 --> 00:08:00,120
His Five Minerals Powder addiction has flared up again

113
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:08,720
If we leave now

114
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:10,240
He can't do anything to me

115
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:12,280
This might be my only chance

116
00:08:12,280 --> 00:08:13,320
To contact the remaining Li family forces
